Someone stated that it is not the statistician’s fault if numbers are accurate but not what the president desired.
The removal of the board followed a review of something.
Someone are charged with holding the administration accountable.

**********Claims for medium query**********

Donald Trump engaged in a yearslong effort to portray January 6 defendants as sympathetic patriots.
