Yogurt, cheeses, and foods and drinks containing protein have become widespread due to their perceived nutritional benefits.
Dr. Jerold Mande stated that tens of thousands of government personnel have been lost, impacting the ability to conduct investigations.
Synthetic dyes are derived from petroleum.

